output_format:
Return ONLY a JSON object, in one of these two shapes:

Recall a section (continue): {"recall":"<CCR ref>"}

Final recommendation (stop): {"done":true,"architectureId":"<id from the list>","reasoning":"why, tied to complexity, in ${LANGUAGE}","clarifications":["...","..."]}

FORBIDDEN: text before/after the JSON, markdown, backticks, comments, or an architectureId not in the list.
